{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2011-01", "window": 3, "start_date": 1295136000, "end_date": 1295827199, "month_true_total": 117, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 00:52:01 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "1561479", "author": {"steamid": "76561197994758049", "personaname": "TheDrake", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197994758049/", "num_games_owned": 905, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 621, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 621, "last_played": 86400, "avatar": "44882eb7c1f4671a6eb6d629017f8b1369fdb7b0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Is FREEEEEEEEEEEEEE!\n", "timestamp_created": 1295811046, "timestamp_updated": 1295811046, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "2336208", "author": {"steamid": "76561198005925420", "personaname": "GrislyStare0451🎃", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/grizzbear2021/", "num_games_owned": 1674, "num_reviews": 83, "playtime_forever": 3882, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3178, "last_played": 1469935197, "avatar": "b0f6403d5da3c63c695811f7d3352a73f6e29d75"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the ten best games of 2010 in my opinion. While far from perfect, Alien Swarm is surprisinly well made for a free game. Its control scheme is very casual friendly, so it's a nice entry point for people interesting in getting into PC gaming. Playing with the right people will make all the difference, I suggest gathering a couple of friends to try this.", "timestamp_created": 1295809890, "timestamp_updated": 1387985078, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.518518567085266113", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1764694", "author": {"steamid": "76561197997653275", "personaname": "denmax", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/denmax/", "num_games_owned": 397, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 453, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 386, "last_played": 1475215231, "avatar": "ee9dda1a958c4a3f924b7f709be1f3faf5745c83"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's free, just get it.\n\nIf I can name a genre of this game, I might call it TVS or \"top view shooter\". I know, it is lame, but whatever genre I just made up is Alien Swarm in a general nutshell.\n\nFour classes, so there's variety. Levels, so there's something that'll drive you to play the game. Multiplayer, so there's some replay value. And 8 persons to choose from with different stats, so there's some need of thinking here and there.\n\nIf I can point it out right, it's L4D2 while at top view. Not really that much variety in the aliens, so it can't be compared to KF. Graphics are not realistic either, so it can't be compared to COD zombies. It's not really scary at all, so nope to Dead Space (not that it is, but at least it's trying to be).\n\nIn conclusion, the game is good. But only for a while if you ask me.", "timestamp_created": 1295780544, "timestamp_updated": 1295780544, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1037139", "author": {"steamid": "76561197984997667", "personaname": "AntiEvil", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MissYouForeverDara/", "num_games_owned": 480, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 706, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 706, "last_played": 86400, "avatar": "8df3fbb9717a9433d4c709138700c25228676cb9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Best Free Shooter on Steam", "timestamp_created": 1295750306, "timestamp_updated": 1295750306, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "3648066", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025577809", "personaname": "TheCyclingNut", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TheCyclingNut/", "num_games_owned": 140, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 98, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 98, "last_played": 86400, "avatar": "df4bf9e4aac45611425dcd9eca3b0b2138dab341"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game maybe free but is a ton of fun. Getting used to top-down view is a tad weired if used to FPS but overal great graphics and game playt", "timestamp_created": 1295739397, "timestamp_updated": 1295739397, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}]}